# What I Learned
  - How to see disk usage
# Commands Practiced
  - `df -h`      / see disk space partitions
  - `du -sh *`   / see size of everything in the current directory
  - `du -sh name`/ see size of the particular item
  - `free -h`    / see memory stats and usage
  - `top`        / task manager stats- realtime
  
# Problems I Faced
  - wanted to see size of a particular item
  - couldnot differentiate between top and journalctl
# How I Fixed Them
